566	    // ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
567	    //  KERNEL INTEGRATION: Spatial Volatility Signal Feed
568	    // ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
569	
570	    /**
571	     * feedKernelSpatialSignal — Converts the GhostSplat heatmap into a
572	     * causal confidence value for the EpistemicTransitionKernel.
573	     *
574	     * High threat density + low prediction confidence = high spatial volatility.
575	     * This signal feeds into the kernel's EMA, allowing the phase classifier
576	     * to distinguish between genuine spatial chaos and background noise.
577	     */
